l(s);","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":542,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001566044-26-000010","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-13","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001566044","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1566044/000156604426000010/vyne-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/f6491d728dfd88c32f8541482df4436fe17ee5dbc818b385687651e5036e1ff6.bin","sha256":"f6491d728dfd88c32f8541482df4436fe17ee5dbc818b385687651e5036e1ff6"}},{"id":"3c307e800c563ceb362bbfd02d020ee896036b5089c622f823bb6c8930a22687","quote":"•the cost of clinical trials of any of our product candidates may be greater than we anticipate;","context":"•we may elect to, or regulators, IRBs or ethics committees may require that we or our investigators, suspend or terminate clinical research or trials for various reasons, including noncompliance with regulatory requirements or a finding that the participants in our clinical trials are being exposed to unacceptable health risks;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":543,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001566044-26-000010","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-13","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001566044","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1566044/000156604426000010/vyne-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/f6491d728dfd88c32f8541482df4436fe17ee5dbc818b385687651e5036e1ff6.bin","sha256":"f6491d728dfd88c32f8541482df4436fe17ee5dbc818b385687651e5036e1ff6"}},{"id":"15a28856eb6bf1a1aba9625cc991636879b2d57a394943c466098ff44975284e","quote":"•the quality of our product candidates or other materials necessary to conduct clinical trials of our product candidates may be inadequate to initiate or successfully complete a given clinical trial;","context":"•the cost of clinical trials of any of our product candidates may be greater than we anticipa